{
  "migration": "547_time_attendance.sql",
  "summary": "Staff Time & Attendance (Ed 2026-10-26). New workpaper tables only: ta_settings (one row: Sunday workweek, Central, 40 h threshold, payroll schedule NULL until entered), ta_employees (enrollment, FK user_profiles), ta_punches (append-only; the database sets the time; reason required), ta_corrections and ta_overtime_requests (one decision by an active admin who is not the employee, reason required, audit_events in the same transaction), ta_activity_summaries (append-only versions) with ta_activity_communities tags, and v_ta_effective_punches (security_invoker). RLS on every table: authenticated reads only its own rows and has no write grant; employees write only through SECURITY DEFINER functions keyed on auth.uid(); owner functions are service_role only. user_profiles and every existing table are untouched.",
  "requires": [
    "546_inspection_closeout_stages.sql"
  ],
  "preflight": [
    {
      "name": "no ta_ tables exist yet",
      "sql": "SELECT count(*)::int FROM information_schema.tables WHERE table_schema = 'public' AND table_name LIKE 'ta_%'",
      "expect": 0
    },
    {
      "name": "audit_events exists (migration 545)",
      "sql": "SELECT count(*)::int FROM information_schema.tables WHERE table_schema = 'public' AND table_name = 'audit_events'",
      "expect": 1
    },
    {
      "name": "user_profiles exists",
      "sql": "SELECT count(*)::int FROM information_schema.tables WHERE table_schema = 'public' AND table_name = 'user_profiles'",
      "expect": 1
    },
    {
      "name": "auth.uid() exists (Supabase auth)",
      "sql": "SELECT count(*)::int FROM pg_proc p JOIN pg_namespace n ON n.oid = p.pronamespace WHERE n.nspname = 'auth' AND p.proname = 'uid'",
      "expect": 1
    }
  ],
  "expected_changes": [
    "Seven new tables (ta_settings, ta_employees, ta_punches, ta_corrections, ta_overtime_requests, ta_activity_summaries, ta_activity_communities) and one view (v_ta_effective_punches). RLS on all tables with own-row SELECT policies for authenticated.",
    "ta_settings gets its single default row (Sunday workweek, 2400 minutes, no payroll schedule). Every other new table starts empty.",
    "Append-only triggers on punches, activity summaries and tags; decide-once triggers on corrections and overtime requests; server-time triggers on insert.",
    "Employee functions (authenticated): ta_punch, ta_request_correction, ta_withdraw_correction, ta_request_overtime, ta_submit_activity. Owner functions (service_role): ta_decide_correction, ta_decide_overtime, ta_set_employee, ta_update_settings. Internal: ta_require_employee, ta_require_admin_actor (no grants).",
    "No existing table or row changes; user_profiles is protected and must be byte-identical."
  ],
